### 获取所有分类
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories

### 获取分类统计
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories/stats

### 根据code获取分类
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories/tang

### 创建分类
POST http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试分类",
  "code": "test",
  "description": "测试用分类"
}

### 更新分类
PUT http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "测试分类-更新",
  "code": "test",
  "description": "测试用分类-更新"
}

### 删除分类
DELETE http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/categories/1
